WEBVTT

00:03:27.026 --> 00:03:31.491
has to take place here, inside me.

00:03:31.491 --> 00:03:35.591
It's my response, my attitude, to oppression

00:03:35.591 --> 00:03:38.442
that I've got control over,

00:03:38.442 --> 00:03:40.742
and that I can do something about.

00:03:40.742 --> 00:03:44.925
And what I need to develop is self-knowledge to do that.

00:03:44.925 --> 00:03:47.424
That means I need to know how I tick,

00:03:47.424 --> 00:03:49.675
when I collapse,

00:03:49.675 --> 00:03:54.009
where my formidable points are,

00:03:54.009 --> 00:03:56.507
where my weaker points are.

00:03:56.507 --> 00:03:57.975
When do I give in?

00:03:57.975 --> 00:04:03.238
What will I stand up for?